Package: fstpindia
Title: Performance of Faecal Sludge and Co-Treatment Plants in India
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Lars", "Schöbitz", , "lschoebitz@ethz.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2196-5015"))
Description: Data on 47 faecal sludge treatment plants and 22 sewage
    treatment plants with co-treatment of faecal sludge in eight Indian
    states, extracted from the 2023 Phase II evaluation of faecal sludge
    and co-treatment systems by the Centre for Science and Environment
    (CSE), New Delhi. The data cover the treatment technologies, the
    quality of faecal sludge, inlet and outlet samples, and the removal of
    organic matter, nitrogen and faecal coliforms.
